WEBVTT

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:15.400
Meet Ananya. She is 29, has melasma and rides a scooter to work in Pune.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:19.400
Today the peak UV in Pune is 7, and it stays above 3 from 9 am to 4 pm.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:32.400
We asked 30 sunscreen users. Eighteen of them apply it only once a day.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:36.400
Twenty-two do not clearly know when to reapply, and twenty-two would or might scan a QR code for a daily plan.

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:41.400
Dr Iyer types one line about Ananya into ShieldCast.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:46.800
The Prescribing Copilot reads Pune's forecast and drafts Pro+, with Gold as the backup.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:52.400
Nothing reaches Ananya until Dr Iyer approves it. Then the QR card prints.

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:57.400
Ramesh scans the card, and the check code proves it came from Dr Iyer.

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:04.400
He dispenses the exact tube, never a substitute, and each verified scan earns him a credit.

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:09.400
Ananya chose to get reminders, so at 6 am the Orchestrator reads the sky and messages her.

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:14.600
Her plan shows today's tube, the exact times and the UV hour by hour.

00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:19.400
One scan opens the ShieldCast app. There is nothing to download and no password to remember.

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:24.400
On Saturday, Ananya plans a trek to Sinhagad fort.

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:29.600
The Patient Companion re-times that day only, to 9:45 am, 11:45 am, 1:45 pm and 3:45 pm.

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:34.400
On day 16 her tube clock shows 4 days left, and one tap holds a refill nearby.

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:39.400
The refill waits at the counter, so both the sale and the protection continue.

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:43.400
The same forecast tells Sun which cities need stock before a high-UV week.

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:47.400
The Restock agent drafts each order, and the pharmacist approves it.

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:52.400
On day 30, Dr Iyer sees who bought, applied and refilled, and the loop closes.

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:59.400
Course Rx: Dr Iyer writes a course, as for any medicine. Twelve weeks is about five tubes.

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:06.400
Season Switch: when humid air turns dry, Rohit's refill moves from Acne to Emulgel, as his doctor allowed.

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:13.400
SunDot: a dot on the cap turns violet in strong sun, a reminder that needs no phone. The app still gives the exact times.

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:18.400
One app joins the doctor, the patient, the pharmacist and Sun, and four agents keep them in step.

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:22.400
A person approves every step that matters.

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:30.400
One pilot in Pune, Mumbai and Bengaluru can prove it within 28 weeks.
